scenario: TOUCH-01
title: Touch screen
area: Touch
rows: F-BOOT-06
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A computer with a touch screen. Start from a cold boot once if you can.
step: Touch the sign-in field with one finger.
expect: The field is chosen where your finger is, not somewhere else on the screen.
clause: tap
step: Touch and drag the finger slowly across the screen.
expect: The pointer follows your finger without jumps.
clause: drag
step: Touch each corner of the screen in turn.
expect: Every corner answers at the place you touched.
clause: corners
step: Touch with two fingers at once, then lift one.
expect: The first finger keeps driving the pointer; the machine does not freeze or click by itself.
clause: two-fingers
